Note on model weights

This repository contains code only. No Apertus model weights are
redistributed here. The Apertus model family is licensed by the Swiss AI
Initiative under Apache-2.0; see https://huggingface.co/swiss-ai for the
official weights and licence text.

The GGUF builds used for local testing were obtained from community
conversions (agentlans/Apertus-v1.1-4B-Instruct-GGUF and
unsloth/Apertus-8B-Instruct-2509-GGUF). Review their individual licences and
metadata before redistributing them.